        "title": "A Spiritual experience not to be missed",
        "text": "This ancient Shiva temple is well known as an important pilgrimage centre for Hindus. It is even mentioned in the Shiva Purana. One is swept away in waves of spiritual bliss as soon as you enter the temple precincts. It is a massive complex with the main Shiva temple and other smaller temples being housed in the inner courtyard. Photography is not allowed inside the inner courtyard. Non-Hindus are also not allowed inside the Inner courtyard. But there is a place from where the temple can be viewed.",
